    "title": "Redbirds Look To Stay Hot At Home; Host Valpo On Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago Illinois State has been a tough team to play in the friendly confines of CEFCU Arena, and it will look to continue that streak at home Thursday night against Valparaiso in the final contest of a three-game homestand. The Redbirds (9-8, 3-3 MVC) are undefeated at home this season (8-0) and are seeking a third-straight victory, while the Beacons (0-17, 0-6 MVC) are looking for their first victory of the season and first in MVC play. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
